WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.907
R

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:11.945 line:78%
CANDIDATEN FOR NEVADA, ADAM

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:15.548 line:78%
LAXALT.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:25.492 line:78%
IN 1919, WORLD WAR I JUST

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:28.628 line:78%
FINISHED.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:30.497 line:78%
HIS WIFE SHIELDED WILSON.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:32.165 line:78%
SHE RAN THE WHOLE ADMINISTRATION

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.900 line:78%
WITHOUT TELLING ANYBODY.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.969 line:78%
THE 32nd PRESIDENT OF THE

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.138 line:78%
UNITED STATES, FDR.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:40.740 line:78%
HE SUFFERED FROM POLIO AND LOST

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:42.842 line:78%
THE ABILITY TO WALK AT THE AGE

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.879 line:78%
OF 39 ROUGHLY.

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:49.182 line:78%
HE WENT ON TO WIN FOUR ELECTIONS

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:52.419 line:78%
IN A ROW, ALL IN A WHEELCHAIR.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:55.055 line:78%
BUT MOST OF THE COUNTRY DIDN'T

00:00:52.519 --> 00:01:00.226 line:78%
KNOW HE WAS IN A WHEELCHAIR.

00:00:55.722 --> 00:01:01.528 line:78%
HE USED A CANE OR SOMEONE'S ARM

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:05.265 line:78%
FOR BALANCE.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:07.233 line:78%
AND THE SECRET SERVICE HAD

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:12.272 line:78%
PICTURES DESTROYED THAT WERE

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:15.175 line:78%
TAKEN BY ROGUE JOURNALISTS.

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:20.080 line:78%
JOHN KENNEDY WORE A WHACK BRACE

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:23.416 line:78%
AND WAS TREATED WITH AND

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:24.617 line:78%
QUESTION LIESERS AND OPIOID PAIN

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:27.320 line:78%
SHOTS.

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:29.856 line:78%
YOU WOULD THINK IT COULDN'T

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.256 line:78%
HAPPEN TODAY WITH AM AS

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:31.925 line:78%
EVERYWHERE.

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:34.928 line:78%
YOU WOULD BE WRONG.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.529 line:78%
THE PANDEMIC FORCED JOE BIDEN

00:01:35.028 --> 00:01:47.040 line:78%
INTO THE BASEMENT WHERE HE COULD

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:50.176 line:78%
HIDE SOME OF HIS.

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:54.414 line:78%
AND THE MEDIA COVERED UP.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:56.216 line:78%
&gt;&gt; DR. BIDEN IS FOR IT?

00:01:55.849 --> 00:02:00.987 line:78%
, MR. PRESIDENT?

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:05.391 line:78%
&gt;&gt; DR. BIDEN THINKS -- MY WIFE

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:08.828 line:78%
THINKS THAT -- THAT I -- THAT WE

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:09.596 line:78%
ARE DOING SOMETHING VERY

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.798 line:78%
IMPORTANT.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:16.202 line:78%
THE MOST COMMON PRICE OF GAS IN

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:18.071 line:78%
AMERICA IS $3.39, DOWN FROM OVER

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:23.476 line:78%
$5 WHEN I TOOK OFFICE.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:31.184 line:78%
BRIAN: IT WAS $2.84 WHEN HE TOOK

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:32.185 line:78%
OFFICE AND IT'S NOW $3.72.

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:37.223 line:78%
HI, GOOD NIGHT EVERYBODY.

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:39.659 line:78%
I DO SUPPORT FRACKING AND I

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:42.095 line:78%
DON'T -- I DON'T -- I SUPPORT

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:43.296 line:78%
FRACKING AND I STAND AND I DO

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:45.365 line:78%
SUPPORT FRACKING.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:48.001 line:78%
I DON'T EVER RECALL IN THE

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:50.003 line:78%
STATUE OF LIBERTY DO THEY SAY

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:52.505 line:78%
TAKE OUR TIRED HUDDLED MASSES

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:55.375 line:78%
AND PUT THEM ON A BUS.

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:58.244 line:78%
HE GOT HIS PENNSYLVANIA HOUSE --

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:59.512 line:78%
&gt;&gt; MR. FETTERMAN WE HAVE TO

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:01.648 line:78%
CONTINUE ON.

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:02.982 line:78%
BRIAN: JOHN FETTERMAN IS NOT

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:04.184 line:78%
WELL.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:06.519 line:78%
IT'S CRYSTAL CLEAR TO ANYBODY

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:08.188 line:78%
WHO WATCHED THAT DEBATE.

00:03:06.619 --> 00:03:09.055 line:78%
OR JUST WATCHED THAT FOR THE

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:12.292 line:78%
FIRST TIME.

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:14.661 line:78%
HE WON'T TAKE QUESTIONS FROM THE

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:17.263 line:78%
PRESS.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:18.831 line:78%
AND HE WON'T RELEASE HIS MEDICAL

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.700 line:78%
RECORDS SINCE THE STROKE.

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:21.768 line:78%
HE'S NOT FIT FOR THE JOB OF

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:26.105 line:78%
SENATOR.

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:28.107 line:78%
BUT HIS ENABLERS ARE GOING ABOVE

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:32.445 line:78%
AND BEYOND TO COVER UP FOR HIM.

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:34.714 line:78%
&gt;&gt; JOHN FETTERMAN HAD SOME

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:35.582 line:78%
SPEECH STRUGGLES DUE TO HIS

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:38.117 line:78%
STROKE.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:41.721 line:78%
BUT HIS AUTHENTICITY WAS THERE.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:42.088 line:78%
&gt;&gt; HE HAD SOME REALLY STRONG

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:44.324 line:78%
COMEBACKS.

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:46.659 line:78%
&gt;&gt; FETTERMAN LOST THE BATTLE

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:47.126 line:78%
LAST NIGHT BUT MAY HAVE WON THE

00:03:46.759 --> 00:03:49.963 line:78%
WAR.

00:03:47.227 --> 00:03:50.830 line:78%
BRIAN: THE PROTECTION ACROSS THE

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.233 line:78%
NEEDS TO STOP.

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:54.767 line:78%
WE CAN HAVE CONTROVERSIAL

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:55.668 line:78%
CANDIDATE, EVEN RADICAL

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.770 line:78%
CANDIDATES SOMETIMES.

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:58.972 line:78%
BUT WE CAN'T HAVE INCAPABLE

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:01.140 line:78%
CANDIDATES.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:04:03.343 line:78%
AND WE MUST UNDERSTAND THAT

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:04.911 line:78%
FETTERMAN IN PENNSYLVANIA CANNOT

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:04.911 line:78%
DO THE JOB AND IT BECO

